CREATE (doc_DOC_0138:Document:EmailCommunication {docId: 'DOC-0138', docType: 'email', title: 'CONFIDENTIAL: Vulnerability assessment results', sourceFile: 'EMAIL_PER-011_375435.eml', classification: 'CONFIDENTIAL', timestamp: datetime('2026-02-24T00:46:08.839903'), contentPreview: '**From:** Julia Blanco Ruiz <julia.ruiz@canalisabelii.es> **To:** Alejandro Moreno **Date:** 2025-10-13 15:43 **Subject:** CONFIDENTIAL: Vulnerability assessment results  ---  Team,  Attached are the results of the penetration test conducted on the Depósito Getafe SCADA network. Key findings:  1. 5 critical vulnerabilities in PLC firmware 2. Default credentials still active on 5 HMI terminals 3. Unpatched CVE-2025-1036 on SCADA gateway 4. Network segmentation between OT and IT is insufficient  F'})
